# Design system — Study Vocabulary

- Ant Design 5 components; theme via `ConfigProvider` with tokens from `src/styles/theme.ts`.
- SCSS modules per component (`*.module.scss`); shared values from `src/styles/_tokens.scss`.
- Shell: sticky top bar (brand · nav ≥lg · theme toggle) + fixed bottom tab bar below lg; content max-width.
- Category colours from `CATEGORY_COLOR` (`src/constants/categories.ts`) — never inline.
- Mobile-first: the study board must work at 360px width.
- Docs: `docs/DESIGN.md`
